    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Gerrit and Julia and we\u2019ve founded a small indie studio! Together with our community on social media and Twitch, we develop our games. Feel free to check us out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store items, earn money, and upgrade your warehouse! You play a small, cute robot who takes care of the belongings of your customers with a gravity gun \u2013 but be careful not to break anything!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Decorate to your heart\u2019s content!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it cozy for yourself and your customers. Hang up pictures, plant beautiful plants, and place a comfy couch for them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/87fee3f602d11fa0e53af2116c928c7e.poster.avif?t=1755558952\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/87fee3f602d11fa0e53af2116c928c7e.webm?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/87fee3f602d11fa0e53af2116c928c7e.mp4?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27 Upgrade your gravity gun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your gravity gun so the battery lasts longer, recharges faster, or can lift heavier items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/68f9ac4204aeb81f116de60714174201.poster.avif?t=1755558952\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/68f9ac4204aeb81f116de60714174201.webm?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/68f9ac4204aeb81f116de60714174201.mp4?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Build your warehouse </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct small storage units to organize your items and set up shelves. How about a little cart or a box? No problem for a few credits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/91a8dab8cbc98860b6205ce706210e36.poster.avif?t=1755558952\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/91a8dab8cbc98860b6205ce706210e36.webm?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/91a8dab8cbc98860b6205ce706210e36.mp4?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Earn your vacation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Isle awaits you, and all your robot friends. Earn enough money for your well-deserved break on The Isle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/9cc030c89895f648359dbbd17b337ef1.poster.avif?t=1755558952\" width=426 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/9cc030c89895f648359dbbd17b337ef1.webm?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/9cc030c89895f648359dbbd17b337ef1.mp4?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Discover the secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden places in your neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/8c2ebfe299a2a88e5ffc234bc55b4021.poster.avif?t=1755558952\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/8c2ebfe299a2a88e5ffc234bc55b4021.webm?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/8c2ebfe299a2a88e5ffc234bc55b4021.mp4?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd16 Meet your customers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know new and exciting characters over time and see what they\u2019ll bring you! Some of our characters are even created by the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/c1345beaabc3bc8d6a8d279c345994ec.poster.avif?t=1755558952\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/c1345beaabc3bc8d6a8d279c345994ec.webm?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/c1345beaabc3bc8d6a8d279c345994ec.mp4?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Gerrit and Julia and we\u2019ve founded a small indie studio! Together with our community on social media and Twitch, we develop our games. Feel free to check us out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store items, earn money, and upgrade your warehouse! You play a small, cute robot who takes care of the belongings of your customers with a gravity gun \u2013 but be careful not to break anything!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Decorate to your heart\u2019s content!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it cozy for yourself and your customers. Hang up pictures, plant beautiful plants, and place a comfy couch for them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/87fee3f602d11fa0e53af2116c928c7e.poster.avif?t=1755558952\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/87fee3f602d11fa0e53af2116c928c7e.webm?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/87fee3f602d11fa0e53af2116c928c7e.mp4?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27 Upgrade your gravity gun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your gravity gun so the battery lasts longer, recharges faster, or can lift heavier items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/68f9ac4204aeb81f116de60714174201.poster.avif?t=1755558952\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/extras/68f9ac4204aeb81f116de60714174201.webm?t=1755558952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source 